    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-02-40",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "青雄黄。英水出焉，而西南流注于汤谷。有神焉，其状如黄囊，赤如丹火"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 9,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-09-09",
      "type": "annotation",
      "annotationExplanation": "即旸(yánɡ)谷，传说中的日出之处"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 9,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-09-09",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "下有汤谷，汤谷上有扶桑，十日所浴，在黑"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 14,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-14-13",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "百里，其叶如芥。有谷曰温源谷、汤谷，上有扶木，一日方至，一日方出"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "chuci",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "entryId": "chuci-03-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "月安属？\n\n列星安陈？\n\n出于汤谷,\n\n次于蒙汜,\n\n自明及晦,"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "chuci",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "entryId": "chuci-05-02",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "\n\n留不死之旧乡。\n\n朝濯发于汤谷兮,\n\n夕晞余身兮九阳。\n\n吸"
    }
  ],
